{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSError","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSError"},{"text":" *) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"error","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"error","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The NSError received from APNs registration failure"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method from your AppDelegate’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"application:didFailToRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithError:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"to notify Pushwoosh about registration failures.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This allows Pushwoosh to:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Log the error for debugging","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retry registration if appropriate"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Update device status in the Control Panel","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"text":"Example","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Handle registration failure with user feedback:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["class AppDelegate: UIResponder, UIApplicationDelegate {","","    func application(_ application: UIApplication,","                    didFailToRegisterForRemoteNotificationsWithError error: Error) {","","        \/\/ Forward to Pushwoosh","        Pushwoosh.configure.handlePushRegistrationFailure(error as NSError)","","        \/\/ Log for debugging","        Logger.error(\"Push registration failed: \\(error.localizedDescription)\")","","        \/\/ Handle specific error cases","        let nsError = error as NSError","        switch nsError.code {","        case 3010:","            \/\/ Simulator or push not supported","            Logger.warning(\"Push notifications not supported on this device\")","","        default:","            \/\/ Track error in analytics","            Analytics.track(\"push_registration_failed\", properties: [","                \"error_code\": nsError.code,","                \"error_message\": nsError.localizedDescription","            ])","","            \/\/ Optionally notify user","            if shouldShowPushError {","                showPushRegistrationError()","            }","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/handlePushRegistrationFailure:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)handlePushRegistrationFailure:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"handlePushRegistrationFailure:","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method","role":"symbol"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/handlepushregistrationfailure:"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Handles push notification registration fai